    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Totakanu nabo Akuj neni a Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani irikakini Solomon akiduk Akai ke Ekapolon ka akai ke erwosit ta ŋaduketa daadaŋ ŋuna abu iŋes totamak adukokin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "totakanu Ekapolon neni a Solomon atakanunet ŋuna a ŋaarei, lopite ŋolopei aris ketakanunia neni keŋ alo Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Ekapolon neni a Solomon, “Adau ayoŋ akiirar akilip kon ka adyekitoi kon, ŋuna ibu iyoŋ kirwor alokiŋaren kaŋ; adau ayoŋ akitaleun Akai na ŋina idau iyoŋ akiduk ka eturubakini ayoŋ ekiro kaŋ eyai ne ŋikaru ka ŋikaru arubakini ayoŋ eŋoliunit ka amina ne jik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai iyoŋ Solomon ani kiwuap ŋakiro kaŋ lopite ŋolo ewuapitor papa kon Daudi a epeitau ka anakiyookino, ido kitiya ŋuna daadaŋ adau ayoŋ akicik iyoŋ, kiwuap ŋikisila kaŋ ka ŋuna atubunit ayoŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋun nai eturubakinia ayoŋ, apukan kon alo Isirael ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, lopite ŋolo eikinitor ayoŋ papa kon Daudi abala, ‘Nyikiŋopikini iyoŋ aryamun ituŋanan ŋini ilunyokin lokicoloŋ kipuka ŋituŋa a Isirael.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani kiŋer iyoŋ, kori ŋidwe kon akiwuapit ŋakiro kaŋ, toesikis akiwuapit Ŋakiciketa kaŋ ŋuna ewuak ayoŋ kiŋaren kon, ido toloto akitiyanakin ka akilip neni a ŋakujo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋun nai alemarya ayoŋ Ŋisirael anakwap a ŋina adau ayoŋ ainakin ikes. Akai daŋ ŋina etaleu ayoŋ aŋuna ekiro kaŋ, alemari ayoŋ ojoŋo akitere; toruwor Isirael akwap ŋina nyeriŋa eyai toruwor ŋina edoŋ erae eemut bon, ŋina ekyenatar ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor Akai na ŋina tokona iteete iyes eoya na ereŋorot ŋolo etukosi ŋakielet keŋ; ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini itori nen, eumokini topodok tema, ‘Kaanukiro etiyaa Ekapolon ŋakiro nu nakwap na ka Kai na?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eboŋokinete nai ŋituŋa temasi, ‘Erae aŋuna aŋeryoto ikes Ekapolon Akuj kec ŋina ayauni atapapaa kec anakwap a Ijipit, ido acamut ikes ŋakujo ŋace, ilipete ikes neni a ŋakujo ŋun ka kitiyanakinete; iŋes nai ayaunia Ekapolon akinyasuno na neni kec.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋatomoniarei kedau Solomon akiduk ŋakais nu ŋaarei: Akai ŋina ke Ekapolon ka akai ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit Solomon inak Iram erwosit ŋolo Tiro ŋitaunio ŋatomoniarei anakwap a Galileya, anerae abu Iram inak Solomon ŋakito ŋuna a Cedar, ŋuna a Cipres ka egolid lotyae daadaŋ ŋolo eitanitor Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani ebuni Iram alo Tiro akiŋolikin ŋitaunio ŋulu ainakini Solomon iŋes, abu Iram nyelakar aŋuna a ŋitaunio a ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu iŋes kiŋit Solomon tema, “Alutaunio lu ŋulu ikiinak iyoŋ ayoŋ lokaato kaŋ?” Aŋun, enyaritae ŋitaunio ŋul Kabul tari tokona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kabul",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A Ŋaburaniyae iŋes atemar akwap ŋina erae acaryoit.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, aris Iram kiyakik Solomon ŋitalantae amiat ka ŋatomoniarei ŋulu a egolid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ŋulu abu Solomon kitiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae lu ŋiticisyo ŋulu abu Solomon toreik ŋituŋa akitiya: Akiduk Akai ke Ekapolon, akai keŋ a elope ka akiduk arwatata nakititis ŋina a etaun ta akiduk ŋarwatatain ŋuna a Yerusalem, Asor, Megido ka Geser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Aris apaki ŋin Parao erwosit ŋolo a Ijipit kelot akikamar Geser kicuny ka toar Ŋikanaani ŋulu eboiyete alo Geser, ido toropya etaun ŋol nakoku keŋ ŋina eisit Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Solomon toduk Geser nabo), abu daŋ iŋes toduk Bes-oron ŋolo ayai nenidipal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalas, Tadimor ŋolo ayai naloŋisat, aya ŋitaunio ŋul daadaŋ nakwap keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Solomon toduk ŋitaunio ŋulu aya ŋisitowae daadaŋ ka ŋitaunio ŋulu a ŋagaari keŋ, ŋulu a ŋikametok ŋaŋolei keŋ ka ŋaduketa ca daadaŋ ŋuna abu Solomon totamak adukokin Yerusalem, Lebanon ka nakwap daadaŋ ŋina epukat iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋipiya daadaŋ ŋulu a ŋituŋa a lu: a Ŋiamori a Ŋiitaiti, a Ŋiperisi, a Ŋiipi ka Ŋiyebusi, ŋituŋa ŋul ŋulu pa arae Ŋisirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikes ŋipiya a ŋiletok a ŋituŋa ka akwap a ŋin ŋulu kepotu Ŋisirael nyemunyasi a nen, abu Solomon toreik ŋul daadaŋ akitiya etic, ido eriŋa tari tokona ereikinitae ikes etic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani eruwor Ŋisirael, pa abu Solomon kituruwo ikes ŋipi; arae ikes ŋasigarya, ŋikapolok anapukan keŋ, ŋikarikok a ŋajorei keŋ, ŋikarikok a ŋajorei ka ŋikarikok a ŋajorei a ŋuna emeto ŋagaari ŋuna iritae a ŋaŋolei ta ŋikajiok ŋulu edokito ŋaŋolei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ekimar a ŋikapolok a ŋulu apolokinito ŋiticisyo a Solomon, ŋamiae ŋakan ka ŋatomonikan. Arae ŋul apolokinito ŋituŋa ŋulu etiyaete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau nakoku a Parao acunar alotaun a Daudi kelot kai keŋ ŋina adukokinit Solomon iŋes, abu Solomon toduk arwatata nakititis ŋina alowae a ŋolo alo Kide Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
