              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋolokaru ayenene Solomon ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ŋuna a ekisil ŋayayet ŋauni Namuroet ŋina abu iŋes toduk a ŋuna ke Ekapolon. Ecunyanakini iŋes ekinyate ka ŋainakineta ŋun alokiŋaren Ekapolon. Aŋun, abu Solomon kirikak akitiya ŋuna amaikina kitiya Kai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
