        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Solomon kitiyau ŋameeli ŋuna alalak alo Esion-Geber, alodiyete Elos alokipetot ka anam a ŋina Areŋan, anakwap ke Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
