          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya Iram ŋiketiyak keŋ a ŋameeli, arae ikes ŋikametok ŋameeli ŋulu ayenete anam ejok. Kiyakiyarae ikes kaapei ka ŋiketiyak a Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
