          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto ikes nakwap ŋina anyaritae Opir, yaut ŋatalantae ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka ŋatomoniarei ŋuna a egolid, inakis erwosit Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
